assable, fail-open, applied after a side effect, evaluated under the wrong identity or tenant, or unsupported by reproducible evidence.', limitations='This bounded ARL-KB-060 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='117c1dc839e7ab444e43b93cc0b96c053564a55883b4f879057c7569b0182a9a', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-060';
