er a side effect, evaluated under the wrong identity or tenant, or unsupported by reproducible evidence.', limitations='This bounded ARL-KB-078 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='85774e6b791c51e1157b7c0facd3662ea24f2cdadcd78a47fa9579d06e82b203', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-078';
