fect, evaluated under the wrong identity or tenant, or unsupported by reproducible evidence.', limitations='This bounded ARL-KB-086 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='7c5a7d88cca3d37e2d641110ada8854c8bae3339b8763d75240888bbf4067d50', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-086';
