l is declaration-only, bypassable, fail-open, applied after a side effect, evaluated under the wrong identity or tenant, or unsupported by reproducible evidence.', limitations='This bounded ARL-KB-090 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='55eb7db2f7005faa09488005250bbd347fd62e262d9e28f6bf07365bc48f8ce3', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-090';
