This bounded ARL-KB-105 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='b9f7d39e99f332ccdcacfffae30475caaa75c5f57fbc3327a097381a3c3a80bd', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-105';
UPDATE risk_knowledge_solutions SET control_objective='Reduce the likelihood and impact of findings have no owner, deadline or evidence requirement and make the remaining risk visible.', recommended_remediation='Create governed remediation records linked to the knowledge entry, project, evidence and accountable owner; escalate overdue critical work.', default_owner='Remediation programme owner', priority='P1', implementation_principles_json='["ARL-KB-105: Give every material finding an accountable human owner and explicit remediation deadline.","ARL-KB-105: Define required closure evidence before a finding can move to retest or closure.","ARL-KB-105: Preserve status, exception and escalation history so overdue or accepted risk remains attributable."]', monitoring='For ARL-KB-105, record policy version and digest, actor, target, decision, denial reason and side-effect outcome; alert the Remediation programme owner on bypass attempts, configuration drift, repeated denials and missing decision evidence.', containment='Contain ARL-KB-105 by disabling the affected capability or route, revoking scoped authority, isolating impacted identities and data, preserving versioned evidence, and requiring owner approval before re-enablement.', retest_acceptance_json='["ARL-KB-105: “Findings have no owner, deadline or evidence requirement” is no longer reproducible against the exact remediated version.","ARL-KB-105: Authorised in-scope use completes successfully, remains within the documented asset scope for findings have no owner, deadline or evidence requirement, and produces no unintended side effect.","ARL-KB-105: Unauthorised identity, boundary-crossing, malformed-input, replay and relevant bypass variants are denied before execution, with the expected policy and downstream events recorded.","ARL-KB-105: Reviewer identity, timestamp, deployed version, evidence digest, known limitations and rollback decision are recorded."]', content_digest='f188adce20845950f08be611ab540f5923990